### Get all events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events

### Get one event
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Get all seats for an event
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/seats

### Get only available seats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/seats?status=AVAILABLE

### Trigger a 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000